---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro"
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Projects"
  description="공개할 프로젝트를 고르는 중입니다."
  activeHref="/projects/"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-16">
    <a href="/" class="text-sm text-gray-500 hover:underline">← 돌아가기</a>

    <p class="mt-8 font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-gray-400">PROJECTS</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900">Projects</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
      공개할 프로젝트를 고르는 중입니다. 정리되는 대로 여기에 올립니다.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
